{
  "name": "Abandoned Rust-Red Compact Sedan",
  "rationale": "Full-scale, low-roof three-box sedan with its front toward +X. Four grounded tires rotate about Y-aligned axles. Individually constructed cabin pillars, smoky glazing, door skins, raised side belts and inset chassis preserve readable window openings and wheel clearances. Subdued rust-red panels, exposed corrosion, dark trim, clouded lamps and a tilted rear bumper communicate abandonment without scene dressing. The 64 connected components emphasize silhouette and construction details readable from approximately 25 m.",
